:: Residential Shady Person
<<effects>><<generate1>>

You approach the shady-looking <<person1>><<person>>, and <<his>> eyes meet yours.
<br><br>

"You look like a fun-loving <<lady>>," <<he>> asserts. "Would you be interested in this batch of cheap SWP pills?"
<br><br>

Your eyes betray your curiosity. "Dynapill Corp. was about to get rid of these in bulk, but I managed to swoop-in just in time to salvage them," <<he>> strikes a prideful pose, as if what <<he>> did was praise worthy. "Thanks to that, I can sell 'em at an unbeatable price in bulk."

The <<person>> gives off shady vibe as hell, and under normal circumstances you'd stir away from people like <<him>>. But knowing just how expensive these pills can be on the open market, you feel kinda tempted to indulge. Even if these aren't regular X-Change pills, but rather unregulated SWP ones.
<br><br>

"I can sell you a batch of 10 pills for <<printprice 10000>>," <<he>> offers. "Think about it. There might be very expensive, long duration variants mixed in the batch." <<He>> grabs one pill from the batch, pinching it between two fingers, to present it to you in an attempt to seal the deal.
<br><br>

"It would be a real bargain," <<he>> concludes. "So, what do you say? Interested?"
<br><br>
<<pillicon "pill">>
<<if setup.inflation.canAfford(10000, "blackMarket")>>
	<<link [[Buy a batch of 10 pills (<<printprice 10000>>)|Residential Shady Person Accept]]>>
		<<if xchangePlayerBaseSex() is "m">>
			<<set $sexStats.pills.pills["Suspicious Pink Pill"].owned += 10>>
		<<elseif xchangePlayerBaseSex() is "f">>
			<<set $sexStats.pills.pills["Suspicious Blue Pill"].owned += 10>>
		<<else>>
			<<set $sexStats.pills.pills["Suspicious Purple Pill"].owned += 10>>
		<</if>>
		<<set $sexStats.pills.boughtOnce to true>>
		<<money -10000 "blackMarket">>
	<</link>>
<<else>>
	You don't have enough cash.
<</if>>
<br>
<<pillicon "pill">>
<<if setup.inflation.canAfford(20000, "blackMarket")>>
	<<link [[Buy a batch of 20 pills (<<printprice 20000>>)|Residential Shady Person Accept]]>>
		<<if xchangePlayerBaseSex() is "m">>
			<<set $sexStats.pills.pills["Suspicious Pink Pill"].owned += 20>>
		<<elseif xchangePlayerBaseSex() is "f">>
			<<set $sexStats.pills.pills["Suspicious Blue Pill"].owned += 20>>
		<<else>>
			<<set $sexStats.pills.pills["Suspicious Purple Pill"].owned += 20>>
		<</if>>
		<<set $sexStats.pills.boughtOnce to true>>
		<<money -20000 "blackMarket">>
	<</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<pillicon "pill">>
<<if setup.inflation.canAfford(30000, "blackMarket")>>
	<<link [[Buy a batch of 30 pills (<<printprice 30000>>)|Residential Shady Person Accept]]>>
		<<if xchangePlayerBaseSex() is "m">>
			<<set $sexStats.pills.pills["Suspicious Pink Pill"].owned += 30>>
		<<elseif xchangePlayerBaseSex() is "f">>
			<<set $sexStats.pills.pills["Suspicious Blue Pill"].owned += 30>>
		<<else>>
			<<set $sexStats.pills.pills["Suspicious Purple Pill"].owned += 30>>
		<</if>>
		<<set $sexStats.pills.boughtOnce to true>>
		<<money -30000 "blackMarket">>
	<</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<set _xchangeSpecialPrice to 50000>>
<<set _xchangeSpecialCost to -_xchangeSpecialPrice>>
<<set _xchangeSpecialOffers to []>>
/* Pink and Blue labelled pills sell on the spot: what your body can't use can still be slipped to someone else. The purple line gets its own pitch. */
<<run _xchangeSpecialOffers.push({ pill: "X-Change Pink Omega", label: "X-Change Pink Omega", icon: "xchangePink" })>>
<<run _xchangeSpecialOffers.push({ pill: "X-Change Blue Alpha", label: "X-Change Blue Alpha", icon: "xchangeBlue" })>>
<<run _xchangeSpecialOffers.push({ pill: "X-Change Pink Beta", label: "X-Change Pink Beta", icon: "xchangePink" })>>
<<run _xchangeSpecialOffers.push({ pill: "X-Change Blue Omega", label: "X-Change Blue Omega", icon: "xchangeBlue" })>>
<<if setup.inflation.canAfford(_xchangeSpecialPrice, "blackMarket")>>
	<<if _xchangeSpecialOffers.length gt 0>>
		<<run V.sexStats ??= {}; V.sexStats.pills ??= {}; V.sexStats.pills.pills ??= {}; if (typeof ensurePillInventoryRecords === "function") ensurePillInventoryRecords(V.sexStats.pills.pills)>>
		<<for _xchangeSpecialOffer range _xchangeSpecialOffers>>
			<<set _xchangeSpecialPill to _xchangeSpecialOffer.pill>>
			<<set _xchangeSpecialLabel to _xchangeSpecialOffer.label>>
			<<set _xchangeSpecialIcon to _xchangeSpecialOffer.icon>>
			<<set _xchangeSpecialText to "Buy an " + _xchangeSpecialLabel + " pill (" + formatMoney(setup.inflation.spendPrice(_xchangeSpecialPrice, "blackMarket")) + ")">>
			<<pillicon _xchangeSpecialIcon>><<capture _xchangeSpecialPill _xchangeSpecialText _xchangeSpecialCost>><<link _xchangeSpecialText "Residential Shady Person Accept">>
				<<run V.sexStats ??= {}; V.sexStats.pills ??= {}; V.sexStats.pills.pills ??= {}; if (typeof ensurePillInventoryRecords === "function") ensurePillInventoryRecords(V.sexStats.pills.pills)>>
				<<set $sexStats.pills.pills[_xchangeSpecialPill].owned += 1>>
				<<set $sexStats.pills.boughtOnce to true>>
				<<money _xchangeSpecialCost "blackMarket">>
			<</link>><</capture>>
			<br>
		<</for>>
	<</if>>
	<<pillicon "xchangePurple">><<link [[Buy special purple variant|Residential Shady Person Purple]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	You don't have enough cash for the labelled pills.
	<br>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[Refuse|Residential Shady Person Refuse]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Residential Shady Person Accept
<<effects>>

"There we go," the <<person>> takes the cash, and with single motion hands you over a tiny box filled with pills. "Pleasure doing business with you," and <<he>> storms off.
<br><br>

<<endevent>>

<<link [[Leave|Residential Alleyways]]>><</link>>

:: Residential Shady Person Refuse
<<effects>>

You tell you're not interested in the offer, and turn to leave.
<br><br>

"Suit yourself," <<he>> shrugs. "This offer's killer. So you'll probably come back." And just as you're barely within earshot, you hear <<him>> whisper under <<his>> breath: "This town will make sure of it, you <<slut>>."
<br><br>

<<endevent>>
<<link [[Leave|Residential Alleyways]]>><</link>>

:: Residential Shady Person Purple
<<effects>>

"Oho? Going straight for the purple stuff?" The <<person>> pauses for a beat, then breaks into an amused grin. "I knew it the moment I laid eyes on you. You really are a fun-looking <<lady>>. The kind that likes to have <i>fun</i>. With a capital F." <<He>> chuckles to <<himself>>, clearly pleased with <<his>> own read on you.
<br><br>

From an inner pocket of <<his>> coat, <<he>> produces three small cases, each stamped with a different mark. "The purple line comes in three flavours, my discerning friend. Omega, for those who want to be filled. Alpha, for those who'd rather do the filling. And the Alpha-Omega combo, for the greedy ones who refuse to choose." <<He>> fans them out like a card trick. "All <<printprice 50000>> apiece."
<br><br>

"So," <<his>> grin widens, "which kind of fun will it be?"
<br><br>

<<set _xchangeSpecialPrice to 50000>>
<<set _xchangeSpecialCost to -_xchangeSpecialPrice>>
<<set _xchangePurpleOffers to []>>
<<run _xchangePurpleOffers.push({ pill: "X-Change Purple Omega", label: "Purple Omega" })>>
<<run _xchangePurpleOffers.push({ pill: "X-Change Purple Alpha", label: "Purple Alpha" })>>
<<run _xchangePurpleOffers.push({ pill: "X-Change Purple Alpha-Omega", label: "Purple Alpha-Omega" })>>
<<if setup.inflation.canAfford(_xchangeSpecialPrice, "blackMarket")>>
	<<run V.sexStats ??= {}; V.sexStats.pills ??= {}; V.sexStats.pills.pills ??= {}; if (typeof ensurePillInventoryRecords === "function") ensurePillInventoryRecords(V.sexStats.pills.pills)>>
	<<for _xchangePurpleOffer range _xchangePurpleOffers>>
		<<set _xchangePurplePill to _xchangePurpleOffer.pill>>
		<<set _xchangePurpleText to "Buy a " + _xchangePurpleOffer.label + " pill (" + formatMoney(setup.inflation.spendPrice(_xchangeSpecialPrice, "blackMarket")) + ")">>
		<<pillicon "xchangePurple">><<capture _xchangePurplePill _xchangePurpleText _xchangeSpecialCost>><<link _xchangePurpleText "Residential Shady Person Accept">>
			<<run V.sexStats ??= {}; V.sexStats.pills ??= {}; V.sexStats.pills.pills ??= {}; if (typeof ensurePillInventoryRecords === "function") ensurePillInventoryRecords(V.sexStats.pills.pills)>>
			<<set $sexStats.pills.pills[_xchangePurplePill].owned += 1>>
			<<set $sexStats.pills.boughtOnce to true>>
			<<money _xchangeSpecialCost "blackMarket">>
		<</link>><</capture>>
		<br>
	<</for>>
<<else>>
	You don't have enough cash.
	<br>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[Never mind|Residential Shady Person Refuse]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Park Shady Person
<<effects>><<generate1>>

You approach the shady-looking, coat-wearing, <<person1>><<person>>, and <<his>> eyes meet yours.
<br><br>

<<if $daily.boughtRemoverPillToday gte 3>>
    "Hey, I'm sorry," <<he>> stonewalls you before you even have a chance to say a word. "We've got other clients who have shown interest in our product. So in the interest of fairness, I can only sell you so many anti-pills each day."
    <br><br>

    "But please, <<sir>>. Do come back tomorrow if you want another fix," <<he>> smiles widely while rubbing <<his>> hands together.
    <br><br>

    <<link [[Leave|Park]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
    
<<else>>
    <<if playerIsXChanged()>>
        "Having some trouble? Perhaps just having some fun?," with a knowing smile, as if seeing right through you, <<he>> continues.  "Either way, I know the signs. You'll surely get some use out of these." 
    <<else>>
        "This town can be ruthless," <<he>> makes a transparently fake show of empathy, bowing <<his>> head as if remourseful. "You look like the type to be made into a victim," <<he>> asserts with a certainty that almost feels offensive when accompanied by those words. "But you know what? I've got the thing just for somebody like you."
    <</if>>
    <br><br>

    From <<his>> pocket <<he>> takes out a bunch of <span class="green">green-looking pills</span>. "These are anti-pills. Authentic Somatic Warp Pharmaceutical (SWP) anti-pills," you reach out with curiosity but <<he>> retreats. "Ah ah ah, not so fast. These get produced in very limited quantities, so they aren't that easy to obtain."
    <br><br>

    <<if !$weekly.shadyPitchDelivered>>
        "In case you're wondering what they do," a bit snotty-nosed, <<he>> goes into a practiced sales pitch. "SWP has been proudly researching into ways to decode the otherwordly magic that is X-Change Pharmaceutics' tech. And one such result of said research has been these little puppies," <<he>> stand proudly as if this was an direct achievement of <<his>>. "Anti-pills."
        <br><br>

        "Pills that target the markers left on the body by the action of regular pills, in order to follow them to the source and neutralise the agents that cause any specified undesirable effect." Your ears perk up once you hear this last part. "You'll no longer have to fear the distressing effects of a Dumb Bitch pill anymore as long as you have its corresponding anti-Dumb Bitch pill at hand."
        <br><br>

        "And all of this for the very low price of <<printprice 50000>> each," you listen intently as <<he>> finalises <<his>> pitch. "But you gotta act now. My stock is limited, and me and my associates will only remain on this town until the end of the week. Decide a minute too late, and you won't even find us."
        <br><br>

        <<set $weekly.shadyPitchDelivered to 1>>
    <<else>>
        Extending <<his>> hand once again to entice you. "Anyway, let's cut to the chase," <<he>> begins. "As my colleague probably explained the other day. These are <<printprice 50000>> each."
        <br><br>
    <</if>>

    "So, what do say you?" <<he>> asks. "Interested?"
    <br><br>

    <<if setup.inflation.canAfford(50000, "blackMarket")>>
        <<if $xchange.removerPillCatalogue.length gt 0>>
            <<set _catalogue = []>>
            <<run $xchange.removerPillCatalogue.forEach(pill => _catalogue.pushUnique(pill))>>
            <<for _type range _catalogue>>
               <<if $debug is 1>> <<run console.log(`SWP Anti-${_type} Pill`)>><</if>>
                <<capture _type>>
                    <<link [[`Buy an anti-${_type} pill (${formatMoney(setup.inflation.spendPrice(50000, "blackMarket"))})`|Park Shady Person Accept]]>>
                        <<set $sexStats.pills.pills[`SWP Anti-${_type} Pill`].owned += 1>>
                        <<set $sexStats.pills.boughtOnce to true>>
                        <<money -50000 "blackMarket">>
                        <<run $xchange.removerPillCatalogue.deleteAt($xchange.removerPillCatalogue.indexOf(_type))>>
                        <<set $daily.boughtRemoverPillToday to ($daily.boughtRemoverPillToday ?? 0) + 1>>
                    <</link>> 
                <</capture>>
                | In Stock: <span class="gold"><<= $xchange.removerPillCatalogue.countWith(pill => pill === _type)>></span>
                <br>
            <</for>>
        <<else>>
            <<He>> has run out of stock.
            <br>
        <</if>>
    <<else>>
        You don't have enough cash.
        <br>
    <</if>>
    <br>
    <<if $xchange.removerPillCatalogue.length gt 0>>
        <<link [[Refuse|Park Shady Person Refuse]]>><</link>>
    <<else>>
        <<link [[Leave|Park]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
    <</if>>
    <br>
<</if>>

:: Park Shady Person Accept
<<effects>>

You purchase the innocuous-looking pill.
<br><br>

"There we go," the <<person>> pockets the cash, and with a single fluid motion, hands you over a tiny padded box containing the pill. 
<br><br>

/* "Pleasure doing business with you," and <<he>> storms off.
<br><br> */

/* <<endevent>> */
<<link [[Next|Park Shady Person]]>><</link>>

:: Park Shady Person Refuse
<<effects>>

You tell you're not interested in the offer, and turn to leave.
<br><br>

"Suit yourself," <<he>> shrugs. 
<br><br>

"The risks of getting spiked in this town do seem pretty high. So you'll probably be back." Barely within earshot, you hear <<him>> mutter under <<his>> breath: <span class="red">"Guess we are not distributing enough pills into this town after all..."</span>
<br><br>

<<endevent>>
<<link [[Leave|Park]]>><</link>>

:: Industrial Shady Person
<<effects>><<generate1>>
<<rng 20 30>>
<<set $temp to {}>>
<<set $temp.goingrate = $rng>>
<<if !$daily.shadydealSeen>>
	<<set $daily.shadydealSeen = true>>
	<<set $daily.shadydeal = $temp.goingrate * 24>>
<</if>>

You approach the shady-looking <<person1>><<person>>, and <<his>> eyes meet yours.
<br><br>

"You look like a fun-loving <<lady>>," <<he>> asserts. "Would you be interested in making a quick buck?"
<br><br>

Your eyes betray your curiosity. "I just happen to have a lucky batch of <span class="lewd"><i>pockethole pills</i></span> in my pocket, and a high demand for <i>service providers</i>," <<he>> makes a winking gesture as if implying you should know what <<he>> means.

The <<person>> gives off shady vibe as hell, and under normal circumstances you'd stir away from people like <<him>>. But the offer of payment feels kind of tempting under your current circumstances. 
<br><br>

Seeing as you aren't reeling away already, the <<person>> continues: "You'd just need to pop one of these right here and now. And I'll take your picture so I can keep track of who I gave this pill to." You feel a hint of hesitation raise up upon the mention of your picture being taken under such a shady deal.
<br><br>

<<if ($portalDealCount ?? 0) lt 7>>
    "The current going rate for this service is <<moneyGainDisplay $temp.goingrate>> per hour. So if you take the 24-hour variant, I'll pay you <<moneyGainDisplay $daily.shadydeal>> on the spot, and you won't have to see me ever again," <<he>> concludes. "So, what do you say? Interested?"
<<else>>
    <<he>> looks you up and down with a knowing smirk. <span class="red">And you can feel that something isn't right</span>. "You know the deal by now. Pop the pill, I take your picture. So, what do you say? Interested?"
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Take the 24-hour variant|Industrial Shady Person Accept]]>><<set $temp.duration to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Take the 3-days variant|Industrial Shady Person Accept]]>><<set $temp.duration to 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Take the 7-days variant|Industrial Shady Person Accept]]>><<set $temp.duration to 7>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Refuse|Industrial Shady Person Refuse]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Industrial Shady Person Accept
<<effects>><<fameprostitution 5>>

<<if xchangePregnancyBlocksPill()>>
	The <<person>> looks you over again, then checks the pill and curses under <<his>> breath.
	<br><br>
	"No. Forget it," <<he>> says, tucking the pill away. "I'm not getting involved with that."
	<br><br>
	<<endevent>><<unset $temp>>
	<<link [[Leave|Industrial Alleyways]]>><</link>>
<<elseif xchangePillProtectionActive()>>
	You pop the pill as instructed.<<xchange-effects $temp.duration `[]`>>
	<br><br>
	The <<person>> waits for the change, then scowls when nothing happens. "No transformation, no picture, no payment. Get lost."
	<br><br>
	<<endevent>><<unset $temp>>
	<<link [[Leave|Industrial Alleyways]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	You pop the pill as instructed.

	<<if playerIsXChanged()>>
		<<xchange-addeffect "portal" $temp.duration>>

		As you do, a feeling of mild warmth raises up from your chest, and then a breeze feeling assaults your crotch.
	<<elseif $player.sex is "m">>
		<<xchange-pink $temp.duration "portal">><<xchange-seen 2>>

		As you do, your body shifts and turns until the distinctive form of a woman takes hold of your flesh. And in addition to that, a now permanent breezy feeling assaults your crotch, making you blush slightly.
	<<else>>
		<<xchange-blue $temp.duration "portal">><<xchange-seen 2>>

		As you do, your body shifts and turns until the distinctive form of a man takes hold of your flesh. And in addition to that, a now permanent breezy feeling assaults your crotch, making you blush slightly.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	"There we go," the <<person>> takes advantage of your stunned state to take your picture<<if ($portalDealCount ?? 0) lt 7>>, and then proceeds to hand you down the previously offered <<moneyGainDisplay `$temp.duration * $daily.shadydeal`>> as payment. "Pleasure doing business with you," and <<he>> storms off.
	<br><br>

	<<silently>><<moneyGain `$temp.duration * $daily.shadydeal`>><</silently>>
	<<else>>. <<He>> glances at <<his>> wallet, then back at you, then pockets it again with a quiet laugh. "Actually... I think you're so far gone, you'd even do this for free." And <<he>> storms off without leaving a penny.<</if>>
	<<set $portalDealCount to ($portalDealCount ?? 0) + 1>>
	<<endevent>><<unset $temp>>

	<<link [[Leave|Industrial Alleyways]]>><</link>>
<</if>>


:: Industrial Shady Person Refuse
<<effects>>

You tell you're not interested in the offer, and turn to leave.
<br><br>

"Suit yourself," <<he>> shrugs. "The money's good. You'll probably come back." And just as you're barely within earshot, you hear <<him>> whisper under <<his>> breath: "And if not for the money... you'll probably do it for the pleasure, you <<slut>>."
<br><br>

<<endevent>><<unset $temp>>
<<link [[Leave|Industrial Alleyways]]>><</link>>
